### ==============================================================================
### Government Welfare Scheme Navigator — HTTP API Playground
### Usable directly in VS Code (REST Client Extension) or IntelliJ / Aqua / Postman
### ==============================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000
@adminEmail = admin@gov.in
@adminPass = AdminPass123!

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 1. HEALTH CHECK
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 2. AUTHENTICATION & CITIZEN ONBOARDING
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name registerCitizen
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ramesh.farmer@example.com",
  "phone": "+919876543210",
  "password": "FarmerPassword123!"
}

###

# @name loginCitizen
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "ramesh.farmer@example.com",
  "password": "FarmerPassword123!"
}

### Store Citizen Token
@citizenToken = {{loginCitizen.response.body.access_token}}

### Get Citizen Profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Update Citizen Profile Demographics
POST {{baseUrl}}/users/me/profile
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "full_name": "Ramesh Kumar Patel",
  "date_of_birth": "1978-05-15",
  "gender": "male",
  "state": "Madhya Pradesh",
  "district": "Sehore",
  "annual_income": 95000,
  "occupation": "farmer",
  "caste_category": "OBC",
  "is_differently_abled": false,
  "has_land": true
}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 3. SCHEME DISCOVERY & SEARCH
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List Paginated Schemes
GET {{baseUrl}}/schemes?skip=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

### Search Schemes by Need / Problem / Keyword
GET {{baseUrl}}/schemes/search?q=fertilizer%20subsidy
Accept: application/json

### List All Scheme Categories & Counts
GET {{baseUrl}}/schemes/categories
Accept: application/json

### Filter Schemes by State & Category
GET {{baseUrl}}/schemes?state=Madhya%20Pradesh&category=Agriculture&limit=5
Accept: application/json

### Get Single Scheme by Slug
GET {{baseUrl}}/schemes/slug/pm-kisan
Accept: application/json

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 4. ELIGIBILITY EVALUATION & HUMAN REASONING
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### Ad-Hoc Fast Binary Match (Anonymous Context)
POST {{baseUrl}}/eligibility/check
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 46,
  "gender": "male",
  "state": "Madhya Pradesh",
  "occupation": "farmer",
  "annual_income": 95000,
  "caste_category": "OBC",
  "has_land": true
}

### Ad-Hoc Human-Friendly Explained Evaluation (Categorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/eligibility/explain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "age": 46,
  "gender": "male",
  "state": "Madhya Pradesh",
  "occupation": "farmer",
  "annual_income": 95000,
  "caste_category": "OBC",
  "has_land": true
}

### Authenticated Citizen Personalized Eligibility Report
GET {{baseUrl}}/eligibility/me/explained
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Single Scheme Verdict Breakdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/eligibility/schemes/1/explain
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 5. CITIZEN DOCUMENT VAULT & READINESS SCORE
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

### List Uploaded Vault Documents
GET {{baseUrl}}/vault/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### Check Document Readiness Checklist for a Scheme
GET {{baseUrl}}/vault/readiness/schemes/1
Authorization: Bearer {{citizenToken}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
### 6. ADMIN CONTROL PLANE & INGESTION
### ------------------------------------------------------------------------------

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{adminEmail}}",
  "password": "{{adminPass}}"
}

### Store Admin Token
@adminToken = {{loginAdmin.response.body.access_token}}

### [Admin] List All Schemes (Across all statuses)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/schemes?limit=5
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [Admin] List Ingestion Feeds & Sync Statuses
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/ingestion/sources
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### [Admin] Trigger Instant Ingestion Run
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/ingestion/run
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
